        "Title": "Hitman 9. Episode 8. Goodbye old friends",
        "Location": "LOCATION_ELEGANT_LLAMA",
        "PublicId": "131241009720",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/elegant/scene_llama.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ef4d0343-bb8f-4432-9868-2ff7835e7969).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47. Today I&apos;ve decided to close this, and I&apos;m going to meet with our bank robbery client, Tamara Vidal. So she&apos;s the big person in this whole project, and she wants to rob us, and destroy the ICA, so we have to do that first. Other targets we have are two snipers, who we&apos;re not sure who they&apos;re working for, but we can&apos;t take any chances knowing that Tamara wants to kill me. Then we have Tamara&apos;s and my own bodyguard. This is big business. We can&apos;t trust anyone... Good hunting, 47",
